WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.625
A chemical change makes a new substance by rearranging atoms.

2
00:00:05.576 --> 00:00:10.701
Hydrogen and chlorine molecules collide; a yellow ring marks each reaction.

3
00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:16.476
The atoms separate and join into new particles: hydrogen chloride.

4
00:00:17.328 --> 00:00:21.953
That makes a new substance; melting only moves the same particles.
